o disappeared on July 19, featured.  [Police Det. Duane BAIRD&#134;- says the search has ended following information from the family.]", "segment_duration": 70, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "1190.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761326, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "bJzSserN2G", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-01", "broadcast_start_time": "0.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761315, "segment_id": "hBlKH0PgBS", "segment_broadcast_id": "bJzSserN2G", "segment_title": "Iraq / Hassoun Case", "segment_description": "(Studio: Don Dahler)  The arrival at his home in West Jordan, Utah, of Marine Cpl. Wassef Hassoun, who has been undergoing the repatriation process after turning up in Lebanon after going missing in Iraq, reported.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "1260.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761327, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "bJzSserN2G", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-01", "broadcast_start_time": "0.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761315, "segment_id": "fDWn4dZjUf", "segment_broadcast_id": "bJzSserN2G", "segment_title": "Alaska / Cruise Ship", "segment_description": "(Studio: Don Dahler)  The grounding of the cruise ship Odyssey in waters off Alaska reported; map shown.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start